I researched Mobbin’s current public product pages, pricing, changelog, Help Center, and official MCP documentation, with the cutoff of October 2, 2026. Below is the most complete publicly verifiable feature inventory I could assemble.
One important distinction: Mobbin has thousands of individual design tags/patterns. I am listing all feature families and individually documented capabilities, rather than pretending that every single tag such as every screen-pattern name is a separate product feature.
Mobbin — Complete Feature List
1. Core design library
